# Normalise line endings in the repository, independent of each machine's
# core.autocrlf. The repo tooling is Bash + Python and the skills are installed
# on Linux/macOS as well as Windows, so LF is the canonical form everywhere.
# Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites files to
# CRLF and every subsequent diff shows whole-file churn.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
